1
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,360
Will you come home for dinner tonight?

2
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:21,480
The suit will arrive this afternoon.

3
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:22,880
I want you to try it on.

4
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:26,560
I have a social engagement tonight.

5
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:27,800
It's up to you.

6
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:31,480
As long as you like it,

7
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:32,640
I will like it.

8
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:34,240
OK.

9
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:40,040
I'm leaving.

10
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:40,680
OK.

11
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,160
I've found it.

12
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:48,240
I went to check it out

13
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,320
after you called me the other day.

14
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,160
The Sunshine Orphanage closed 26 years ago.

15
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,040
The director emigrated overseas.

16
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,600
I found an employee from that time.

17
00:02:58,040 --> 00:03:00,160
He said the orphanage didn't have any management issues.

18
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:02,280
It was all a sudden decision made by Director Li.

19
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,320
This is Director Li's

20
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,040
address in Singapore.

21
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,160
Coincidentally,

22
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,480
her daughter is the manager of Golden Thread's branch.

23
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:12,360
But Ms. Li rarely contacts her.

24
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:13,160
As for this matter,

25
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:13,920
don't worry,

26
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,760
I'm a tight-lipped person.

27
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,800
But why do you suddenly investigate this?

28
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,720
I'm investigating for a friend.

29
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:22,440
He was adopted by this orphanage.

30
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,760
With the wedding coming up,

31
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,040
you're investigating your friend's background.

32
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:26,320
Do you need my help?

33
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:26,960
No.

34
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,320
I gave him the information,

35
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,600
he'll handle it himself.

36
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:33,040
By the way,

37
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:36,920
there's nothing unusual

38
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,360
about your brother-in-law.

39
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:43,320
Then we need to investigate thoroughly,

40
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,560
and make sure nothing is overlooked.

41
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,600
Do you hope I find something

42
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,440
or find nothing?

43
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:52,400
Of course, it's best to find nothing.

44
00:03:57,880 --> 00:03:58,600
Hello?

45
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,000
I'll be there soon.

46
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,440
What's wrong?

47
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:07,120
Mumu got into a fight at school.

48
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,040
I have to go there.

49
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,480
Is your kindergarten a zoo?

50
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,440
This brat must be expelled today.

51
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:14,000
Please calm down.

52
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,760
Lu Mu's parents will be here soon.

53
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:22,560
Mumu,

54
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,720
who started it?

55
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:24,560
He deserved it.

56
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,640
He stole the toy car my uncle bought me.

57
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,600
Did you hear that?

58
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:28,880
This wild child

59
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:29,560
must be expelled immediately.

60
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,280
Principal,

61
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:31,480
check the surveillance.

62
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,520
You better hope my son started it first.

63
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:35,400
Otherwise,

64
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,720
I'll break your arms and legs.

65
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,320
Look at her.

66
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,640
Is she even making sense?

67
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:42,800
Look at what Lu Mu did to my child!

68
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,360
Let go!

69
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,520
What do you want?

70
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,520
Yan, take the child and go.

71
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,240
If this isn't resolved today,

72
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,200
don't even think about leaving!

73
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:54,000
Don't make me repeat myself!

74
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:55,200
What else do you want?

75
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:55,640
Huh?

76
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,960
What do you want?

77
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,400
Calm down.

78
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,040
Take the child to the hospital first.

79
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,200
We'll handle

80
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:01,760
the rest.

81
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:02,920
What?

82
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,760
You want to get rid of us like this?

83
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,680
We're not short of money.

84
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,520
Why did she leave?

85
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,000
I'm telling you,

86
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:14,320
I'm not afraid of your grandma.

87
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:16,480
Don't think you can do anything

88
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,720
just because you're rich.

89
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:18,560
There are

90
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,400
many rich families in this world.

91
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,400
Tell Lu Qianqian

92
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,560
to bring Lu Mu here

93
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,720
and apologize to my son within three days.

94
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:26,520
Okay.

95
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,080
Let's go.

96
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,320
Who did this?

97
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,360
I'm calling the police.

98
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,880
I did it.

99
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:41,080
Crazy woman.

100
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,080
What do you want?

101
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:44,280
My husband is...

102
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,400
Mom, are you okay?

103
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,520
You'll kill her if you keep beating her.

104
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,240
I, Lu Qianqian, have never

105
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,240
said sorry since childhood.

106
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,440
If you keep making trouble,

107
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:05,840
tell your husband to prepare for bankruptcy.

108
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,240
This is the medical expenses.

109
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:11,960
Call the police

110
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,000
or take the money.

111
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:15,320
Go back and discuss it with your husband.

112
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,920
I, Lu Qianqian,

113
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,760
will accompany you to the end.

114
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:22,680
Go.

115
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,560
You've regressed.

116
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,720
You've progressed too fast.

117
00:06:59,640 --> 00:07:00,680
This sword school

118
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,240
is an exact replica.

119
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:05,000
You really like that sword school in France.

120
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,840
After returning from France,

121
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:15,280
I became obsessed with our encounter that day.

122
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,200
So,

123
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,720
I recreated this fencing hall

124
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:23,160
exactly as it was.

125
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:26,560
But you kept avoiding me when I approached.

126
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:36,880
Because, as you said,

127
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:39,800
I was afraid.

128
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:42,000
Not afraid anymore?

129
00:07:45,080 --> 00:07:45,880
Still afraid.

130
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,400
But wild grass

131
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:54,120
will naturally entangle

132
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,040
with other weeds.

133
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:55,520
Isn't it?

134
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:58,040
Your words to coax people

135
00:07:58,400 --> 00:08:00,000
are as exquisite as sword techniques.

136
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:02,480
No wonder Lu Qianqian is so devoted to you.

137
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,160
Compared with you,

138
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:10,280
I think I still have room for improvement.

139
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,800
I'll take a bath first.

140
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,400
It looks so real.

141
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,800
Did brother-in-law paint it?

142
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,360
He still can't forget that woman.

143
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:01,040
With your status and position,

144
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:04,040
is it worth it for that woman

145
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,360
who doesn't love you?

146
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:09,400
He's your brother-in-law.

147
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,960
I won't say it if you don't like to hear it.

148
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,960
What are you doing?

149
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:29,000
When I was a child and I was unhappy,

150
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,240
you would coax me with juice.

151
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:32,600
Today,

152
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:34,800
I'll have a couple of drinks with you.

153
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:38,240
What?

154
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,000
Are you afraid you can't drink me under the table?

155
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:55,240
Our son was bullied at school,

156
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,400
and fought with other children.

157
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,600
You don't go back to be with him,

158
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:00,160
but book this restaurant

159
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,600
to have a candlelight dinner with me.

160
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,800
Lu's children don't need to be indulged.

161
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,520
If there's really a problem,

162
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:07,840
Lu's people will solve it.

163
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:11,800
You're really a good father.

164
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,320
Do you know

165
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:23,360
why Xiao Mumu's name is Lu Mu

166
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:24,960
instead of Zhou Mu?

167
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:27,160
I...

168
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:31,240
I don't even have a child with my last name.

169
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:32,960
I don't deserve them.

170
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:35,320
I'm not worthy.

171
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,480
So, compared to a father,

172
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:40,920
I'm more like

173
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:43,240
an assigned administrator.

174
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:48,400
The life of a wealthy family that makes countless people jealous.

175
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:51,560
Under this golden and jade garment,

176
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,040
there is indeed only a bone

177
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:55,240
without temperature and flesh.

178
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:59,400
It's really ironic and realistic.

179
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:04,760
Don't you really consider Zhuang Wan's proposal?

180
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:07,440
She can give you much more than this.

181
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,320
Change a yard,

182
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,440
and be another gatekeeper.

183
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,800
Do you think there's any difference?

184
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:31,320
I've been waiting for an opportunity,

185
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:38,040
to completely change Lu Mu

186
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:40,560
into Zhou Mu

187
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:43,400
by my own strength.

188
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,800
Then let's create this opportunity together.

189
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:17,680
Do you know why I chose to take over this restaurant?

190
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,000
Because this is

191
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:25,040
the best platform overlooking the Golden Thread and Lu family.

192
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,120
From now on,

193
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,200
you are my ally

194
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,480
and my only accomplice.

195
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:52,320
Love

196
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:57,080
is just a well-planned scam by dopamine.

197
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:00,840
It first gives you a piece of candy,

198
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:04,280
then forces you to swallow ten pounds of broken glass.

199
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:08,040
It says it's eternal,

200
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:11,280
but in reality, it's shorter than the shelf life

201
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:14,240
of discounted fruits wrapped in plastic film in supermarkets.

202
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,800
Yesterday, you said I was your destiny.

203
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,400
Zhou Jian.

204
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,680
Tomorrow, it can turn into

205
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:25,960
we are not compatible in personality.

206
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:27,960
Zhou Jian, don't go!

207
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,320
Don't leave me!

208
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,120
The most passionate actor,

209
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:43,760
even the ring is a prop.

210
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:47,040
After filming, it has to be returned to the makeup team.

211
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:54,800
Do you know why fairy tales only go up to the wedding?

212
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,480
Because after that, it has to be turned into a suspense film.

213
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,480
Guess who cheats first,

214
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,840
who's scheming over property,

215
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,080
and whose "love forever"

216
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,600
gets withdrawn first.

217
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:20,800
Anyone who believes in love tied to interests

218
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:25,560
will end up lining up and drawing numbers

219
00:14:26,280 --> 00:14:27,680
between the Civil Affairs Bureau and the mental hospital.

220
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:46,200
Jiang Li's live stream has you cornered.

221
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:48,280
Now only I can help you.

222
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:49,760
I'm coming to you.

223
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,160
Brother-in-law.

224
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:58,400
You're done.
